{"acceptance_length": 8.232558139534884, "acceptance_lengths": [3, 6, 11, 10, 4, 7, 12, 2, 7, 5, 9, 4, 14, 6, 5, 6, 5, 16, 9, 9, 7, 3, 11, 16, 9, 5, 6, 16, 16, 15, 16, 13, 2, 3, 4, 3, 9, 13, 16, 6, 1, 11, 3], "accepted_draft_lengths": [2, 5, 10, 9, 3, 6, 11, 1, 6, 4, 8, 3, 13, 5, 4, 5, 4, 15, 8, 8, 6, 2, 10, 15, 8, 4, 5, 15, 15, 14, 15, 12, 1, 2, 3, 2, 8, 12, 15, 5, 0, 10, 2], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 23388434432, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 23388417024, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "We are given the following information:\n\n- The auditorium has **4 rows** of seats.\n- Each row has **18 seats**.\n- **One-fourth** of the seats were occupied by **administrators**.\n- **One-third** of the **remaining** seats were occupied by **parents**.\n- The **rest** were occupied by **students**.\n\nWe are to find: **How many students were there in the school auditorium?**\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Total number of seats\n\nThere are 4 rows, with 18 seats in each row:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total seats} = 4 \\times 18 = 72\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Seats occupied by administrators\n\nOne-fourth of the seats were occupied by administrators:\n\n$$\n\\text{Admin seats} = \\frac{1}{4} \\times 72 = 18\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Remaining seats after administrators\n\n$$\n\\text{Remaining seats} = 72 - 18 = 54\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Seats occupied by parents\n\nOne-third of the remaining seats were occupied by parents:\n\n$$\n\\text{Parent seats} = \\frac{1}{3} \\times 54 = 18\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Remaining seats for students\n\nThese are the seats not occupied by administrators or parents:\n\n$$\n\\text{Student seats} = 54 - 18 = 36\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{36}\n$$\n\nThere were **36 students** in the school auditorium.", "decode_seconds": 1.5766648477874694, "draft_calls": 43, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 91, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "16cf8c2000e8b55e51ce3c60c7707d0a98229e4818cf9471a234fa20e7bc660b", "method": "relay_svd1536", "