{"acceptance_length": 7.416666666666667, "acceptance_lengths": [3, 7, 6, 2, 4, 2, 7, 3, 7, 12, 2, 7, 5, 2, 7, 5, 6, 2, 9, 1, 4, 7, 10, 5, 16, 1, 12, 11, 11, 14, 4, 3, 4, 6, 15, 2, 16, 7, 16, 16, 7, 10, 3, 15, 16, 10, 8, 8], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 23388434432, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 23388417024, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "We are given the following information:\n\n- The auditorium has **4 rows** of seats, with **18 seats in each row**.\n- **One-fourth** of the seats were occupied by **administrators**.\n- **One-third** of the **remaining** seats were occupied by **parents**.\n- The **rest** were occupied by **students**.\n\nWe are to find the number of **students**.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 1: Total number of seats**\n\nThe auditorium has:\n\n$$\n4 \\text{ rows} \\times 18 \\text{ seats per row} = 72 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 2: Number of seats occupied by administrators**\n\nOne-fourth of the seats were occupied by administrators:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4} \\times 72 = 18 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Remaining seats after administrators**\n\nSubtract the seats occupied by administrators from the total:\n\n$$\n72 - 18 = 54 \\text{ seats remaining}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 4: Number of seats occupied by parents**\n\nOne-third of the remaining seats were occupied by parents:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3} \\times 54 = 18 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 5: Number of seats occupied by students**\n\nSubtract the seats occupied by parents from the remaining seats:\n\n$$\n54 - 18 = 36 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{36}\n$$\n\nSo, **36 students** were in the school auditorium.", "decode_seconds": 1.7423314270563421, "draft_calls": 48, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 91, "method": "native_target_dflash", "output_hash": "201182090a8615a616ebe88a93bb8be0d6ac6c78d6e0f703509d8808945dc202", "output_tokens": 355, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 23494513152, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 23783